{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜CHARGESPOT三萬借電站納入《Pokémon GO》地圖 玩家捉精靈可即場租電           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">共享外置充電器服務商CHARGESPOT與手機遊戲《Pokémon GO》營運方合作，自11月14日起，日本、香港、台灣、泰國、新加坡、英國、意大利、澳洲及美國九個國家及地區、約三萬個CHARGESPOT借電站，將陸續納入遊戲地圖，化身「寶可補給站」及「道館」。玩家收集道具或參與團體戰期間，可即場租借外置充電器。營運商INFORICH表示，期望玩家毋須憂慮電量耗盡，盡情探索城市。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T04:19:19.961397+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T03:00:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:49.985208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T04:12:49.985208+00:00","content_hash":"502459604e3e065bf99548dc703633657644ee8f2dcc73c0b5867ef64b8124a2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}